{"hw":"ἱκανόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἱκανόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἱκαν-όω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make sufficient, qualify</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">2 Ep.Cor.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.6</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be empowered,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">PTeb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.8</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B.C.)</span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be made complete, brought to perfection</b>, of the soul, <span class=\"gk\">τῷ περιέχοντι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hierocl.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.9A.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be satisfied, content</b>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">τινι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.H.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.74</span> </span>: abs., Teles<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.39</span> </span> H., cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ma.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.10</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἱκανούσθω ὑμῖν</span>, c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">let it suffice</b> you.., i.e. do it no more, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">3 Ki.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.28</span> </span>, al.: abs., ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.7</span> </span>.</div></div>"}